; Week 10: widening [value] with VArray/VTable is meant to force every
; existing match over a value to be revisited -- promote OCaml's
; non-exhaustive-match warning (8) to a hard build error so that
; forgetting a case anywhere is a compile failure, not a silent runtime
; crash discovered later.
(library
 (name snobol)
 (flags (:standard -warn-error +8)))
